|---|---|---|
| First run | Synchronous call at startup | `RunOnce` → `CheckAndPresign` (`server.go:163`) |
| Repeats | `time.NewTicker` every **12h** | `runnerInterval = time.Hour * 12` (`runner.go:26-40`) |
